<mj-section
  background-color="#fff"
  border-radius="6px 6px 0px 0px"
  padding-bottom="24px"
  padding-left="48px"
  padding-right="48px"
  padding-top="48px"
  padding="48px"
>
  <mj-column padding="0">
    <mj-spacer height="24px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text color="#000000" font-size="32px" line-height="1.25" padding="0px">
      <strong>We received your report</strong>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section
  background-color="#fff"
  border-radius="0px 0px 6px 6px"
  padding-bottom="48px"
  padding-left="48px"
  padding-right="48px"
  padding-top="20px"
  padding="48px"
>
  <mj-column padding="0">
    <mj-spacer height="12px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      Dear <%= @first_name %> <%= @last_name %>,
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="24px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      Thank you for taking the time to report a concern to the Young Scandinavians Club. We've received your report and take it seriously.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="12px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      <strong>Report Summary:</strong>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="8px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px" background-color="#f8f9fa" border-radius="4px" padding="16px">
      <%= @summary %>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="24px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="16px" background-color="<%= if @anonymous, do: "#fff3cd", else: "#e7f3ff" %>" border-radius="4px" border="2px solid <%= if @anonymous, do: "#ffc107", else: "#1976d2" %>" color="<%= if @anonymous, do: "#856404", else: "#004085" %>">
      <%= if @anonymous do %>
        <strong>Your name stays private from the people this report is about.</strong><br/><br/>
        <strong>What this means:</strong> The YSC Board of Directors can still see your name and contact information so they can follow up with you. They will not share that information with the people involved in what happened.
      <% else %>
        <strong>You did not ask us to hide your name from the people this report is about.</strong><br/><br/>
        The board still handles your report carefully and privately. If you have privacy concerns, use <a href="<%= contact_url() %>">our contact page</a>.
      <% end %>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="24px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      <strong>What happens next?</strong>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="12px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      • The YSC Board of Directors will review your report carefully and confidentially
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="8px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      • The board will follow the Code of Conduct process
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="8px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      • Someone will contact you if they need more information
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="8px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      • The board will decide next steps based on what they learn
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="24px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      We appreciate your commitment to maintaining a safe and respectful environment within our community. Your report helps us ensure that the Young Scandinavians Club remains a welcoming place for all members.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="12px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      If you have questions or more details to add, use <a href="<%= contact_url() %>">our contact page</a>.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="24px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">
      Thank you again for your report.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="24px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px">Best regards</mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="18px"></mj-spacer>
    <mj-text align="left" font-size="18px" line-height="1.5" padding="0px" color="#666">
      The Young Scandinavians Club Board of Directors
    </mj-text>
    <mj-spacer height="12px"></mj-spacer>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
